rting -- srd053 R1.1-R1.4\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd053-sort.yaml (sort SRD -- focus on requirements R1.1 through R1.4)\n      - docs/specs/use-cases/rel07.0-uc001-sort.yaml (sort use case for behavioral context)\n      - pkg/sys/sigpipe.go (SIGPIPE handler pattern required by all cmd/ utilities)\n      - cmd/head/main.go (example cmd/ package showing project structure and flag parsing conventions)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/sort/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: sort utility entry point, flag parsing foundation, core line sorting, and I/O handling\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R1.1 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R1.2 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R1.3 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R1.4 as specified in the SRD\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per project convention\n      - id: D2\n        text: Follow the same flag parsing and error handling patterns as other cmd/ packages in this repository\n      - id: D3\n        text: Target LC_ALL=C locale behavior only per project architecture decision DD6\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: cmd/sort/main.go exists and compiles with go build -o bin/sort ./cmd/sort/\n      - id: AC2\n        text: go vet ./cmd/sort/ reports no issues\n      - id: AC3\n        text: Requirements R1.1 through R1.4 from srd053-sort.yaml are implemented as specified\n      - id: AC4\n        text: The binary calls sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at program start\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"cmd/sort: sorting options and field separator -- srd053 R1.5-R1.7, R2.1\"\n  dependency: 0\n  description: |\n  