t numeric sort mode\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R2.2 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R2.3 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R2.4 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R3.1 as specified in the SRD\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Extend the existing comparison logic to support key-based field extraction and comparison\n      - id: D2\n        text: Target LC_ALL=C locale behavior only per project architecture decision DD6\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: cmd/sort compiles with go build -o bin/sort ./cmd/sort/\n      - id: AC2\n        text: go vet ./cmd/sort/ reports no issues\n      - id: AC3\n        text: Requirements R2.2, R2.3, R2.4, and R3.1 from srd053-sort.yaml are implemented as specified\n      - id: AC4\n        text: Previously implemented functionality from R1.1-R1.7 and R2.1 is preserved\n\n- index: 3\n  title: \"cmd/sort: remaining numeric modes and check mode -- srd053 R3.2-R3.4, R4.1\"\n  dependency: 2\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd053-sort.yaml (sort SRD -- focus on requirements R3.2, R3.3, R3.4, R4.1)\n      - cmd/sort/main.go (existing implementation -- extend with additional sort modes and check functionality)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/sort/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add remaining numeric sort modes and auxiliary check functionality\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R3.2 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R3.3 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement srd053-sort requirement R3.4 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement